 "text": "Just look at the drawers on this vanity. If your makeup is living in a bag under the sink or your current setup just isn't cutting it anymore, look at this. You've got twelve drawers on the vanity plus two more in the stool, so you can actually give everything a place: makeup, jewelry, perfume, all of it. And the top is glass, so you can actually see what you have before opening a drawer. I'd honestly grab this sooner rather than later because holiday shipping is about to get slower, and it comes in three boxes, so you'll wanna give yourself some time to put it together. And it's on a crazy sale right now, so if you see the orange cart below, I'd check it before that deal or the vanity is gone.",
